if GameState.get_flag("act1/said_farewell") == true:
	Aeia watches from the tower window and mouths for you to come back to her whole.
	jump end
She turns as you reach the top of the cracked steps. "You are heading out then" she says quietly. She can see it on you already.
- "I will be back before the banners are hung."
	She almost smiles. "You had better be."
- "Come join us down by the shore."
	"Someone has to keep this village standing while the men play at heroes," she says. "I will be here when you return."
She reaches out and squeezes your hand once. "Be careful out there."
[signal arg="set_flag act1/said_farewell"]
label end